	(text_box "INPUT PROTECTION\nF201 PTC: I_hold 0.50A (0.33A at 70C) > Iin max 0.12A(total estimated consumption); Vmax 30V.\n\nD201 SMBJ18CA: V_RWM 18V > 17V max supply;\n	V_BR 20-22.1V; V_C 29.2V max.\n\nQ201 Si2319CDS reverse-polarity PFET.\n	V_DS -40V > 29.2V clamp. R_DS(on)=0.108 ohm -> 13 mV drop \n	at 0.12A(total budget)<0,4V.\n\nD202 12V Zener keeps V_GS within +-20 Vabs max; I_Z <= (29.2-12)V/100k = 0.17mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 15.6321 0)
		(size 82.55 28.8179)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
