				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2c74665-f9ca-4e20-9c3e-2ed83d163bc8")
	)
	(text_box "3V3 RAIL\nU201 TPS7B6933-Q1: V_IN 4-40V (45 V abs max).\n\nC203 >= 0.1uF at input; \nC204 >= 2.2uF with ESR < 2ohm (LDO stability).\n\n3V3 tolerance (+-3 %) negligeable: ACS781 output and thresholds are both ratiometric to 3V3.\n\nD203: I = (3.3 - 2.0)V / 1k = 1.3mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 80.01 0)
		(size 77.47 22.86)
